2449
00:16:29,997 --> 00:16:32,467
<i>The correct answer is
“The Boomerang Star.”</i>

2450
00:16:32,467 --> 00:16:36,497
<i>An interplanetary emigration ship
built by the human race long ago.</i>

2451
00:16:36,497 --> 00:16:39,467
