2489
00:18:20,807 --> 00:18:23,477
Clumps of ancient methane gas
in its solid form.

2490
00:18:23,477 --> 00:18:24,807
In the second half of
the 21st century…

2491
00:18:24,807 --> 00:18:26,977
the most promising
alternative energy source…

2492
00:18:26,977 --> 00:18:29,007
for fossil fuels and
nuclear power was?

2493
00:18:30,277 --> 00:18:31,647
I don’t know.

2494
00:18:32,887 --> 00:18:34,787
<i>The correct answer was
Methane Hydrate.</i>

2495
00:18:35,817 --> 00:18:37,057
Question.

2496
00:18:37,057 --> 00:18:40,827
As a result of the chain-collapse
of the methane hydrate beds…

2497
00:18:40,827 --> 00:18:44,097
what percentage of living creatures
on earth were wiped out?

2498
00:18:44,097 --> 00:18:45,287
100 percent!

2499
00:18:46,127 --> 00:18:47,797
<i>The correct answer is
85 percent.</i>

2500
00:18:47,797 --> 00:18:49,837
How could it be 100 percent?

2501
00:18:49,837 --> 00:18:52,427
If that were the case,
everyone on the planet would be gone.

2502
00:18:52,607 --> 00:18:54,297
Oh, yeah.

2503
00:18:55,507 --> 00:18:56,307
Question.

2504
00:18:56,807 --> 00:19:00,047
The plan to restore the human race
had a double letter acronym.

2505
00:19:00,047 --> 00:19:01,807
Those two letters were
double… what?

2506
00:19:02,077 --> 00:19:04,287
This is your chance.
Just try saying some letters and see.

2507
00:19:04,287 --> 00:19:06,517
Double O! Double M!
Double P! Double…

2508
00:19:07,957 --> 00:19:09,557
<i>The correct answer is
Double P.</i>

2509
00:19:09,557 --> 00:19:11,457
Right on!
Now you’re cookin’!

2510
00:19:12,687 --> 00:19:13,657
